> encourage cheating, but there are already easier ways to cheat. And there's

Some encryption could be used for the file. I think something like rot-13
is enough. I think it is good enough to prevent somebody looking at the
file from involuntarily getting spoiled, because like you said, wizard
mode bones are already an easier way to cheat.

